--- a/.andromeda/test-plan.md
+++ b/.andromeda/test-plan.md
@@ -141,3 +141,3 @@
 decision/human-tty-through-outer-pty · Human TTY rendering through the outer PTY — The CLI's human TTY rendering is tested under a pseudo-TTY through the outer-PTY driver, not by screen inspection of the child agent. · guard: cross_list_rows_dim_a_stale_row_end_to_end_on_a_terminal
-decision/local-command-post-condition · Local commands confirmed by post-condition only — On a verified CLI /clear is confirmed only by a session-start of cause clear with a new session id, /compact only by one of cause compact with the unchanged id, and /mcp only by a new stdout tag in the transcript past its pre-paste end; none by a prompt-submitted, a missed one is not-delivered.
+decision/local-command-post-condition · Local commands confirmed by post-condition only — On a verified CLI /clear is confirmed only by a session-start of cause clear with a new session id, /compact only by one of cause compact with the same id, and /mcp and /context only by a new stdout tag past the transcript's pre-paste end; none by a prompt-submitted, a missed one is not-delivered.
 decision/mcp-frame-tools-check-instance-first · MCP frame tools check the instance first — The MCP frame tools send, wait, last and answer run the instance strict-modes check before the liveness pre-check, a refused instance getting no frame and no line. · guard: handlers_frame_tools_refuse_a_widened_instance_before_any_frame
@@ -566,2 +566,3 @@
 decision/live-failing-reading-not-verification · Live reading recorded as read, never as verification — A live reading that fails a ledger row is recorded as read and never as verification of the row; a confounded live reading leaves the row unverified on that CLI version and its live re-read owed.
+decision/live-rig-hint-cell-reading · Live rig hint-cell reading recorded as a reading — The live rig's hint-cell reading records the attribute words of every drawn hint cell past the cursor cell after the second send, as a reading and never as verification; no drawn cell reads unread (no-cell).
 decision/mcp-stdio-test-owns-child · MCP stdio test owns the child — MCP stdio tests run an rmcp client over a viola mcp child the test spawns and owns, closing its stdin and awaiting its exit, never rmcp's TokioChildProcess, beside a replay of the recorded MCP exchange.
@@ -854,3 +855,3 @@
 contract/fake-agent-input/compact · viola-fake-agent input · /compact — Under --framing the probed /compact fires the set's recorded SessionStart.compact-1 with session_id set to the last SessionStart the agent fired (only a SessionStart whose fixture exists moves it) and no UserPromptSubmit.
-contract/fake-agent-input/echo-command · viola-fake-agent input · echo-confirmed local command — Under --local-command-mode a submitted local command whose post-condition is the stdout tag, and under --framing the exact verify echo probe command, append one stdout tag line to the last started session's transcript and fire no hook.
+contract/fake-agent-input/echo-command · viola-fake-agent input · echo-confirmed local command — Under --local-command-mode a submitted local command whose post-condition is the stdout tag, and under --framing the exact verify echo probe command or the exact /context probe command, append one stdout tag line to the last started session's transcript and fire no hook.
 contract/fake-agent-input/framing-paste · viola-fake-agent input · --framing paste — Under --framing a compiled paste text of verify's Run B fires its recorded paste-1, paste-2 or paste-3 variant instead, its bytes unchanged; a set without the variant fires nothing for it.
@@ -879,2 +880,3 @@
 decision/link-since-asserted-by-shape · Link time asserted by shape — The link line's since time is asserted by its shape only. · why: It is stamped outside the clock seam.
+decision/private-fake-for-no-transcript · No-transcript tests run a private fake-agent copy — A test that must have no fake-agent transcript removes none from the shared build; it runs its own private copy of the fake agent in a test-owned directory. · why: Transcripts sit beside the fake's exe, a path every concurrently running test of the shared build shares, so removing one would race them.
 decision/product-state-never-hand-written · On-disk product state produced by viola — On-disk product state in tests is produced only by running real viola verbs against the fake agent in a fresh home, never hand-written. · except: The chaos tests, which corrupt files the product already wrote; the server-identity impostor cases; and the MCP handler suite's own snapshots.
